OMPOSITION =E2=86=92 FINAL PRINT
PROOF =E2=86=92 PRODUCTION.

TOP 5 CUSTOMER REQUESTS TO PRODUCTIZE

   1. Exact individual-pet likeness with explicit approval/correction.
   2. Preserve that identity in motion/talking animation.
   3. Multi-pet support from separate source photos.
   4. Personality-driven comedy rather than generic pet templates.
   5. Production-representative physical proof so the delivered
   card/product matches what was approved.

STRONGEST UNMET NEED
A personalized comedy product that remains recognizably the exact pet
across photo =E2=86=92 stylized identity =E2=86=92 animation/voice =E2=86=
=92 physical gift.

EASIEST CONVERSION-LIFT CHANGE TO ORDERING FLOW
Add a reassuring line beside the physical-product CTA: =E2=80=9CYou approve=
 the
exact print layout before we make it.=E2=80=9D Then show the real card
boundary/crop/QR rather than a generic lifestyle mockup.

BEST NEW ETSY LISTING/PRODUCT IDEA FROM ACTUAL CUSTOMER LANGUAGE
=E2=80=9CYour Dog Roasts Dad =E2=80=94 Personalized Talking Pet Birthday Vi=
deo + QR Card =E2=80=94
Approve Your Pet AND Final Card Before Printing.=E2=80=9D The approval prom=
ise
directly attacks an evidenced trust failure in personalized pet products.

IMPORTANT NEGATIVE SIGNAL
Do not let a polished digital preview imply that the physical item is
guaranteed to look identical unless the production pipeline is actually
validated. Preview-first can backfire when print/manufacturing changes the
output; buyers explicitly compare the received product against the
approved/rendered representation.

